</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Every concept, all desires,</l><l>I now forsake for You!</l><l>Shine on all that I can’t see,</l><l>On all that is not You!</l><l>Live Your life, live Your life.</l><l>I’ve been crucified with You.</l><l>Every moment, I would live in oneness,</l><l>Lord, with You!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>When I struggle, grant me grace</l><l>To turn my eyes on You!</l><l>Keep my heart so close to You,</l><l>My love, so fresh and new!</l><l>Come in, Lord! Come in more!</l><l>I would seek none else but You!</l><l>All my life, my love, my all, I pour it,</l><l>Lord, on You!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
